{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":9,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":317,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1900515,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":283937,"Name":"SUREKHA","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1436964140,"LastPoster":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1900515,"PostDate":1436964140,"PostContent":"Hi All I am getting married at Moon Palace this October, have chosen a beach wedding and have bee...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"surekha_18@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"62.172.139.39","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1436781592,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"SUREKHA","Id":283937,"Name":"SUREKHA","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"62.172.139.38","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3b7baa63ff584c90ba2a3ea85ac818dd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi All&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am getting married at Moon Palace this October, have chosen a beach wedding and have been allocated the Caribbean Beach spot, I have also chosen the Caribbean Rooftop Terrace, recommended by Alejandra at the hotel.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We have decided to go with Dreamart for photo and video as the ouside vendors with the fee was working out too expensive. &amp;nbsp;We chose 5 hours photo and 4 hours video to ensure we capture the getting ready, wedding ceremony, cocktail hour and reception. &amp;nbsp;Any thought or tips on this?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We are currently thinking about DJ or IPod.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Also decor for the ceremony, I am thinking to go with the white tables and chairs and add some colour with sashes and table runners, was also considering taking my own. &amp;nbsp;Has anyone doen this before and were you charged to have these set up?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Any tips and ideas would be much appreciated.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Surekha&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900515,"PostDate":1436964140,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi All<\/p>\n<p>I am getting married at Moon Palace this October, have chosen a beach wedding and have been allocated the Caribbean Beach spot, I have also chosen the Caribbean Rooftop Terrace, recommended by Alejandra at the hotel.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We have decided to go with Dreamart for photo and video as the ouside vendors with the fee was working out too expensive. \u00a0We chose 5 hours photo and 4 hours video to ensure we capture the getting ready, wedding ceremony, cocktail hour and reception. \u00a0Any thought or tips on this?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are currently thinking about DJ or IPod.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Also decor for the ceremony, I am thinking to go with the white tables and chairs and add some colour with sashes and table runners, was also considering taking my own. \u00a0Has anyone doen this before and were you charged to have these set up?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Any tips and ideas would be much appreciated.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Surekha<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"surekha_18@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"62.172.139.39","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1436781592,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"SUREKHA","Id":283937,"Name":"SUREKHA","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.143.226.169","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8c5d20e1736ed85ac2e3ccb8e9517719","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community and Congrats on your upcoming Moon Palace wedding, Surekha!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You&#039;ve picked a really picturesque venue for your Special Day - as you can see in these magical wedding \"moments that matter\" Linc captured at some weddings there........enjoy :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;.... &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153122555899487.1073741922.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Moon Palace Wedding Album 1: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/10446337_10153122558924487_4799204771487359697_o.jpg\" alt=\"10446337_10153122558924487_4799204771487\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;.....&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153058061334487.1073741919.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Moon Palace Wedding Album 2:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/10960290_10153058074174487_1506614105010351576_o.jpg\" alt=\"10960290_10153058074174487_1506614105010\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;.....&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10151930921014487.1073741866.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Moon Palace Wedding Album 3: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/1412812_10151930923244487_505331647_o.jpg\" alt=\"1412812_10151930923244487_505331647_o.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy research and planning - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900556,"PostDate":1436999920,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community and Congrats on your upcoming Moon Palace wedding, Surekha!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You've picked a really picturesque venue for your Special Day - as you can see in these magical wedding \"moments that matter\" Linc captured at some weddings there........enjoy <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>.... <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153122555899487.1073741922.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Moon Palace Wedding Album 1: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/10446337_10153122558924487_4799204771487359697_o.jpg\" alt=\"10446337_10153122558924487_4799204771487\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>.....<a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153058061334487.1073741919.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Moon Palace Wedding Album 2:<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/10960290_10153058074174487_1506614105010351576_o.jpg\" alt=\"10960290_10153058074174487_1506614105010\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>.....<a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10151930921014487.1073741866.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Moon Palace Wedding Album 3: <\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/1412812_10151930923244487_505331647_o.jpg\" alt=\"1412812_10151930923244487_505331647_o.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy research and planning - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280196260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"73.150.69.53","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b21dd4049edd0a0326f6df150e9dd052","RawContent":"Hi is this in Cancun? I was looking at moon palace cancun and read some undesirable feedback regard the hotel itself and the fishy smell of the beach . Would you recommend ?","Attachments":[],"Id":1900883,"PostDate":1437514013,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi is this in Cancun? I was looking at moon palace cancun and read some undesirable feedback regard the hotel itself and the fishy smell of the beach . Would you recommend ?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"chrisleotta126@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"73.150.69.53","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1437466439,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Chris126","Id":284060,"Name":"Chris126","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"92.40.248.85","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c99e421a31a9575374e03b6cde8d3900","RawContent":"My wedding here is booked now!\n\nI had read so many good reviews and a few bad \ud83d\ude16 the good seem to weigh out over the bad.\n\nI think the hotel itself will be amazing and the wedding planners at the hotel seem to be really good at what they do.","Attachments":[],"Id":1900899,"PostDate":1437527688,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                My wedding here is booked now!<br>\nI had read so many good reviews and a few bad \ud83d\ude16 the good seem to weigh out over the bad.<br>\nI think the hotel itself will be amazing and the wedding planners at the hotel seem to be really good at what they do.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"surekha_18@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"62.172.139.39","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1436781592,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"SUREKHA","Id":283937,"Name":"SUREKHA","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.232.32.196","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0f9ac98acfadf02670d15c321b653a8e","RawContent":"I am also getting married at moon palace this October! I was wondering where the Caribbean rooftop terrace was though? I don&#039;t remember seeing that as a reception option, is it under cover? I&#039;m trying to see if there&#039;s other options in case it rains, right now we&#039;re planning for the Tucan terrace.","Attachments":[],"Id":1900900,"PostDate":1437536477,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am also getting married at moon palace this October! I was wondering where the Caribbean rooftop terrace was though? I don't remember seeing that as a reception option, is it under cover? I'm trying to see if there's other options in case it rains, right now we're planning for the Tucan terrace. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"colleentf09@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"68.48.23.35","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1414411914,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280885.jpg?_r=1414462566","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"colleentf09","Id":280885,"Name":"colleentf09","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"92.40.248.85","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5c4b92fa89795fbac40875669f66dbf6","RawContent":"I think it&#039;s on the grand side. Above the el caribeno restaurant. \n\nThe picture I was shown is shows that it&#039;s is outside but from the pictures I saw online it looks like there is a section undercover also.  If you type moon palace Caribbean terrace into google images a few wedding reception pics pop up.\n\nWhere are you having your wedding ceremony?  Have you seen the wedding script? I emailed the wedding coordinator to ask for a copy no reply yet","Attachments":[],"Id":1900901,"PostDate":1437537426,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I think it's on the grand side. Above the el caribeno restaurant. <br>\nThe picture I was shown is shows that it's is outside but from the pictures I saw online it looks like there is a section undercover also.  If you type moon palace Caribbean terrace into google images a few wedding reception pics pop up.<br>\nWhere are you having your wedding ceremony?  Have you seen the wedding script? I emailed the wedding coordinator to ask for a copy no reply yet\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"surekha_18@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"62.172.139.39","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1436781592,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"SUREKHA","Id":283937,"Name":"SUREKHA","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.48.159.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0c44cea7c43f91d3687762f7aa1567e7","RawContent":"@[member=\"colleentf09\"] yes, it&#039;s on the Grand side. There&#039;s actually extra charges for having private events here since it&#039;s a rooftop terrace and servers have to go up a flight if stairs. I&#039;ve heated great things about it though.\n\n\nI&#039;m also at Tucan Terrace. A previous bride moved her reception to the Tucan gazebo when it rained but she didn&#039;t have a large number of guests. She said it was a beautiful setting","Attachments":[],"Id":1900969,"PostDate":1437594302,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"280885\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/280885-colleentf09\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">colleentf09<\/span><\/a> yes, it's on the Grand side. There's actually extra charges for having private events here since it's a rooftop terrace and servers have to go up a flight if stairs. I've heated great things about it though.<br><br>\nI'm also at Tucan Terrace. A previous bride moved her reception to the Tucan gazebo when it rained but she didn't have a large number of guests. She said it was a beautiful setting\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"My planning thread: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/<\/a><br><br>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;4;484\/st\/20160123\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/44c5\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>","Email":"jerilee.valenzuela@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"24.114.26.77","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1410084185,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1431039162","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wafflesmom","Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"94.197.121.222","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"41c4cb4614c9ee42c9e1a7400606214e","RawContent":"I have just had an email to say that due to the refurbishment works to the grand the Caribbean terrace is now going to be closed.\n\nQuite disappointing news especially since planning the reception around this area and visualizing it set up for these months now","Attachments":[],"Id":1901001,"PostDate":1437613598,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I have just had an email to say that due to the refurbishment works to the grand the Caribbean terrace is now going to be closed.<br>\nQuite disappointing news especially since planning the reception around this area and visualizing it set up for these months now \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"surekha_18@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"62.172.139.39","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1436781592,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"SUREKHA","Id":283937,"Name":"SUREKHA","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b5ecd445d6d4c9b7a38d0941929f8f87","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"SUREKHA\"] Moon Palace is MASSIVE and there are SOO many perfect spots there to have your wedding. I know It&#039;s probably a disappointment to have to move terraces, but I think once you see the other options in person you will be really happy with them. I&#039;ve stayed at the resort myself and the grounds are lovely no matter what section you&#039;re in.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901024,"PostDate":1437650485,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283937\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283937-surekha\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">SUREKHA<\/span><\/a> Moon Palace is MASSIVE and there are SOO many perfect spots there to have your wedding. I know It's probably a disappointment to have to move terraces, but I think once you see the other options in person you will be really happy with them. I've stayed at the resort myself and the grounds are lovely no matter what section you're in.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419423414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79396","Title":"Moon Palace Bride To Be - Tips And Ideas Please","LastPostDate":1437650485},"Pages":{"TotalItems":9,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
