Etobicoke so can easily shoot down on the subway. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;ve picked up a few weekend shifts this summer, but right now August is the most clear for me - is that too far? &amp;nbsp;And the weekend would probably be best I think.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1896895,"PostDate":1432300538,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277519\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277519-veryvalentine\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">veryvalentine<\/span><\/a> I would love to meet you regardless! \u00a0And hear all the stories from your wedding!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281478\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281478-perianjay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">perianjay<\/span><\/a> \u00a0Downtown patio sounds perfect! I'm in Etobicoke so can easily shoot down on the subway. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I've picked up a few weekend shifts this summer, but right now August is the most clear for me - is that too far? \u00a0And the weekend would probably be best I think.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"deannaproteau@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421428169,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1435939613","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"deecol","Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.0.142.65","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79202,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by Moments That Matter, 23 May 2015 - 12:18 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1432383488,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9e02a7f2dd3c9fbffc9b31510e23a4ca","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;What a great idea you guys!!! there&#039;s nothing quite as special as girlfriends to share and understand each other.....best of luck with a great meeting - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/t31.0-8\/471572_10150957704624487_1950324022_o.jpg\" alt=\"471572_10150957704624487_1950324022_o.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xaf1\/t31.0-8\/256423_10151036235764487_1589698082_o.jpg\" alt=\"256423_10151036235764487_1589698082_o.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/883061_10151481582249487_2110370697_o.jpg\" alt=\"883061_10151481582249487_2110370697_o.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/859593_10151822968739487_291859434_o.jpg\" alt=\"859593_10151822968739487_291859434_o.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpf1\/v\/t1.0-9\/420455_10151189198454487_1157687673_n.jpg?oh=a405b73d2d6efad0684594737f77bd45&amp;amp;oe=5601762C\" alt=\"420455_10151189198454487_1157687673_n.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1897104,"PostDate":1432383425,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>What a great idea you guys!!! there's nothing quite as special as girlfriends to share and understand each other.....best of luck with a great meeting - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/t31.0-8\/471572_10150957704624487_1950324022_o.jpg\" alt=\"471572_10150957704624487_1950324022_o.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xaf1\/t31.0-8\/256423_10151036235764487_1589698082_o.jpg\" alt=\"256423_10151036235764487_1589698082_o.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/883061_10151481582249487_2110370697_o.jpg\" alt=\"883061_10151481582249487_2110370697_o.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/859593_10151822968739487_291859434_o.jpg\" alt=\"859593_10151822968739487_291859434_o.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpf1\/v\/t1.0-9\/420455_10151189198454487_1157687673_n.jpg?oh=a405b73d2d6efad0684594737f77bd45&oe=5601762C\" alt=\"420455_10151189198454487_1157687673_n.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280196260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.15.187","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79202,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"36d214ff7adeeffde6639cdcbd1dd0d5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;If you don&#039;t mind old, I&#039;d love to join. I&#039;m in Mississauga, but work at University &amp;amp; Queen. And I think any brand new brides should absolutely join you ladies. That way you can get all the details! And no - I do not mind if you&#039;d rather keep it to the young ladies!! lol&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1897124,"PostDate":1432419759,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>If you don't mind old, I'd love to join. I'm in Mississauga, but work at University & Queen. And I think any brand new brides should absolutely join you ladies. That way you can get all the details! And no - I do not mind if you'd rather keep it to the young ladies!! lol<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.48.160.15","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79202,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c43d22ba28c54c12058051063e6bef46","RawContent":"What a great idea! I am totally down. I have always wanted to meet and greet everyone! \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1897152,"PostDate":1432497723,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                What a great idea! I am totally down. I have always wanted to meet and greet everyone! <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sabrina_cajuste@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"184.145.50.207","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1414924118,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"Breena","Id":280962,"Name":"Breena","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79202,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"da94a05878003e274bd1def501465298","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;This is so exciting!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Should we pick a weekend in August? &amp;nbsp;It&#039;s still a couple months away so gives us all lots of time.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m good for any weekend except the long weekend (first weekend in August). &amp;nbsp;How is everyone else?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1897172,"PostDate":1432544843,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>This is so exciting!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Should we pick a weekend in August? \u00a0It's still a couple months away so gives us all lots of time.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm good for any weekend except the long weekend (first weekend in August). \u00a0How is everyone else?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"deannaproteau@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421428169,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1435939613","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"deecol","Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","IsOnline":true}}],"Id":"79202","Title":"Toronto (Gta) Brides Meet Up?!","LastPostDate":1437402497},"Pages":{"TotalItems":77,"TotalPages":8,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":70},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
